% Create telecom ARFF data (Age, MonthlyCharge, ContractType, Churn); apply J48 and report confusion matrix.

@relation telecom_churn

@attribute Age numeric
@attribute MonthlyCharge numeric
@attribute ContractType {Monthly,Yearly}
@attribute Churn {Yes,No}

@data
25,80,Monthly,Yes
45,120,Yearly,No
30,90,Monthly,Yes
55,150,Yearly,No
28,70,Monthly,Yes
50,130,Yearly,No
35,95,Monthly,No
60,160,Yearly,No
